      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "vague"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Halbur’s residents are primarily engaged in agriculture, manufacturing, and transportation, reflecting the broader rural economy of Carroll County, where farming dominates.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        28
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/halbur_iowa",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The Halbur Ridge Wildlife Area, a public space managed for conservation and recreation, was transferred to the City of Halbur in 2024 to facilitate trail development.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        29,
        30
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
