      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/halbur_iowa",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "The early settlement of the Halbur area in Carroll County occurred during Iowa’s mid‑19th‑century westward expansion, as European immigrants sought fertile prairie lands after statehood in 1846.",
